Subset keeps only U+6771 (東, CJK UNIFIED IDEOGRAPH-6771) plus .notdef,
made with fonttools 4.67.0 subset at development time (never at test time):

    python3 -m fontTools.subset NotoSansJP-wght.ttf --unicodes="U+6771" \
        --output-file=NotoSansJP-subset.ttf --layout-features='' \
        --no-hinting --desubroutinize --name-IDs='*' --glyph-names \
        --recalc-bounds --recalc-timestamp --canonical-order \
        --no-recalc-timestamp

Face index 0, units per em 1000, advance of U+6771 is 1000 (full width).
